 "text": "My name is Leo, and Kevin Durant is my hero. I know his game by heart. The lethal crossover. The high release. That unstoppable pull-up middy. I couldn't shoot like KD. I couldn't dribble like him. Every time I shot, it clanked off the backboard. Then, one Friday, my dad took me to a real Thunder game. After warmups, I leaned over the tunnel holding my beat-up basketball. KD walked right up and signed it. I wish I had your talent.",
